Use this structure:
{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "task": "string",
      "person": "string or null",
      "deadline_or_time": "string or null",
      "suggested_action": "string"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "issue": "string",
      "suggested_solution": "string"
    }
  ]
}

Note:

